# AquaOS environment templates
#
# Each app reads its own env file. Copy the example file for the app you run:
#
#   apps/web/.env.example      -> apps/web/.env.local   (NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL)
#   services/api/.env.example  -> services/api/.env     (AI_PROVIDER, defaults to mock)
#
# Do not put real secrets in example files. Service-role credentials must stay server-side.
